The Hilbert-curve order follows D. Hilbert (1891); the check digit is H. M. Damm's
algorithm (2004). Spot codes are N-Ways' own 3 m grid in UTM zone 31N (Krüger's transverse
Mercator series); the cards also show the gate's Plus Code (Open Location Code, Apache 2.0
specification by Google). The national outline and the area seeds are derived from
OpenStreetMap (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL).
